flowchart TD
  A[Customer opens product] --> B[Choose variant ID & quantity]
  B --> C[Add to cart]
  C --> D[Server quote price and availability]
  D --> E{Available and price accepted?}
  E -->|No| F[Show changed price or stock; request confirmation]
  F --> B
  E -->|Yes| G[Submit order with idempotency key]
  G --> H[Transaction locks stock and coupon]
  H --> I{Enough available?}
  I -->|No| J[Rollback; 409 error]
  I -->|Yes| K[Reserve stock and snapshot items]
  K --> L[Create payment and order; commit]
  L --> M[Show order code and payment instructions]
